<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 182-day T-bill purchases below supply.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 182-day T-bill purchases below supply.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sale of Lithuanian 182-day Treasury bills undershot supply at an auction on Tuesday, when the average yield was 14.50 percent, the central bank said.</p>
<p>This compared with a 14.13 percent yield at yesterday's sale of 106-day paper.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas.  MATURITY  AV YIELD  LAST TIME   MIN/MAX    ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 182-day    14.50	14.13    12.0/15.30   30    35.5  18.947</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is October 4 and the bills mature on April 4 next year.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
